{"unit_id":"hw-cola__dsh-message-enhancer#feature-1","repo":"hw-cola/dsh-message-enhancer","commit":"04dce8a0159ae87bb51e5ab7e24ab6619c325b3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh/message-enhancer 的功能「消息与计划索引」：在聊天输入框旁显示已加载的用户消息、steering 消息和计划刻度。悬停可预览内容，点击刻度会将对应消息滚动到聊天区域；需要更早历史时可触发宿主分页加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:97-120","lib/client.js:147-190","lib/client.js:343-456"]}
{"unit_id":"hw-cola__dsh-message-enhancer#feature-2","repo":"hw-cola/dsh-message-enhancer","commit":"04dce8a0159ae87bb51e5ab7e24ab6619c325b3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh/message-enhancer 的功能「计划审批与历史卡」：在计划审批界面展示可复制、可阅读的计划卡，并在聊天工具视图呈现已结束的计划。用户可以查看审批结果和计划文本，历史卡支持展开阅读。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:743-917","lib/client.js:936-1124"]}
{"unit_id":"hw-cola__dsh-message-enhancer#feature-3","repo":"hw-cola/dsh-message-enhancer","commit":"04dce8a0159ae87bb51e5ab7e24ab6619c325b3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh/message-enhancer 的功能「回复完成提醒」：在通用设置中选择提示音并可开启浏览器通知。会话回合以 completed 或 max-tokens 正常结束时触发提醒；用户中止或模型错误等结束原因不会触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1142-1179","lib/client.js:1262-1295","lib/client.js:1487-1529"]}
{"unit_id":"hw-cola__dsh-message-enhancer#feature-4","repo":"hw-cola/dsh-message-enhancer","commit":"04dce8a0159ae87bb51e5ab7e24ab6619c325b3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh/message-enhancer 的功能「编辑最后一条消息并重发」：最后一条用户消息可切换为行内文本编辑器，保存后从此前已完成的回合创建子会话并发送修改文本；成功后归档原会话。该操作仅重发文本内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1577-1610","lib/client.js:1796-1823","lib/client.js:1835-1983"]}
